                        "entry_id": "fe4a6f89-b0f3-30ad-bd94-01ac06f24c81",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Southward, southerly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cceb3af-fe14-4396-a009-3cc07bc904e6",
                                "sense_id": "f6659b1a-baf9-3e9d-b021-0374f6faf000",
                                "text": "[…] the said river flowed in a southernly direction, and thence around said Dean's Island, and at or about the southwest end thereof the river turned […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "937ddc15-67d5-495b-9588-c54e640589da",
                                "sense_id": "f6659b1a-baf9-3e9d-b021-0374f6faf000",
                                "text": "[…] thence in a southernly direction in the center line of Alabama street to the center line of Fifteenth street; thence in an easternly direction in the […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63a31c41-2b9c-348a-901b-a7bb36aa2357",
                        "entry_id": "fe4a6f89-b0f3-30ad-bd94-01ac06f24c81",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a Southern manner, in a way typical of a Southerner or of the South (the southern United States)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4eba2941-b2b1-45b0-b660-47d27df7cf3d",
                                "sense_id": "63a31c41-2b9c-348a-901b-a7bb36aa2357",
                                "text": "“The good Lord seemed fond of sending us southerners many trials!” Christa murmured, […] “We were ever in sympathy with our more southernly sisters!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "786c7dc4-ed69-4e98-8163-67c74d6a0e37",
                                "sense_id": "63a31c41-2b9c-348a-901b-a7bb36aa2357",
                                "text": "Mama and Daddy, being typical southerners, had also taught us to politely [offer food] […] [I] only politely offer Phe Phe a slice of my apple to fulfill my southernly duty."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5de4414b-97eb-4071-a70a-90838d469170",
                                "sense_id": "63a31c41-2b9c-348a-901b-a7bb36aa2357",
                                "text": "Our school experience was blissfully and southernly white."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
